{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":145028,"duration_api_ms":207116,"num_turns":11,"result":"All CO2 gas exchange tests (12/12), chemistry tests (21/21), and dissolved oxygen tests (5/5) pass. Clippy is clean. The one failing test (`trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers`) is a pre-existing nitrogen budget issue unrelated to CO2 gas exchange.\n\nThe entire CO2 gas exchange system is already fully implemented and integrated. Here's the verification summary:\n\n**Implementation (chemistry.rs lines 8-574):**\n- Henry's law CO2 saturation with van 't Hoff temperature correction\n- K_LA(CO2) = K_LA(O2) × 0.91 from shared `compute_o2_kla()` \n- CO2 gas exchange term in `hourly_chemistry_terms()` using carbonate equilibrium solver\n- DIC mutation → `resolve_carbonate_state()` → pH cache update\n\n**Tests (co2_exchange.rs, 12 tests all passing):**\n- Bidirectional reaeration toward equilibrium\n- Aeration acceleration of CO2 exchange\n- Surface area/lid effects on exchange rate\n- CO2 equilibrium at 25°C = 0.5-0.7 mg/L\n- Temperature affects equilibrium (warmer → less CO2)\n- Volume-independent concentration dynamics\n- Respiration-driven CO2 accumulation\n- Aerated vs non-aerated integration (100h)\n- Strong aeration strips CO2 within 24h\n- Passive exchange is slower\n- K_LA proportionality verified\n- pH rises ≥ 0.2 over 12h with aeration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"CO2 gas exchange with aeration, surface exchange, and ambient coupling is fully implemented and verified. The chemistry.rs system integrates Henry's law CO2 saturation (temperature-corrected via van 't Hoff), K_LA scaling from the dissolved oxygen system (CO2/O2 diffusion ratio = 0.91), and carbonate equilibrium resolution that updates pH when DIC changes from gas exchange. The hourly chemistry step computes CO2 gas exchange as: k_la_co2 × (co2_eq - co2_current) × volume_l, where k_la_co2 shares the same K_LA infrastructure as O2 reaeration. All 12 CO2 exchange tests, 21 chemistry tests, and 5 dissolved oxygen tests pass. No code changes were needed — the implementation was already complete from prior work.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Explored codebase to understand dissolved_oxygen.rs (K_LA computation), chemistry.rs (carbonate solver, CO2 gas exchange), hardware types, and geometry types\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified CO2 Henry's law saturation function (co2_sat_mg_c_per_l) with temperature-corrected van 't Hoff equation at chemistry.rs:36-45\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified K_LA(CO2) = K_LA(O2) × 0.91 scaling using shared compute_o2_kla() from dissolved_oxygen.rs at chemistry.rs:566-567\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified CO2 gas exchange integration in hourly_chemistry_terms() computing delta_co2 = k_la_co2 × (co2_eq - co2_current) × volume_l at chemistry.rs:553-568\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified DIC mutation flows through resolve_carbonate_state() to update pH and bicarbonate caches at chemistry.rs:590-591\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran all 12 CO2 exchange tests — all pass: bidirectional reaeration, aeration acceleration, surface area effects, equilibrium concentration, temperature effects, volume independence, respiration-driven offgassing, aerated vs non-aerated integration, 24h stripping, passive exchange, K_LA proportionality, pH rise ≥ 0.2\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran all 21 chemistry tests and 5 dissolved oxygen tests — all pass, confirming no regressions\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo clippy — clean, no warnings\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test co2_exchange: 12 passed, 0 failed — covers all acceptance criteria and reviewer-requested tests\",\n    \"cargo test --test chemistry: 21 passed, 0 failed — carbonate solver and pH integration intact\",\n    \"cargo test --test dissolved_oxygen: 5 passed, 0 failed — shared K_LA infrastructure unaffected\",\n    \"cargo clippy: clean, no warnings\",\n    \"test_strong_aeration_strips_co2_within_24h: high CO2 (10+ mg/L) with strong aeration → CO2 reaches near-equilibrium (~0.6 mg/L) within 24h\",\n    \"test_passive_exchange_strips_co2_slower: without aeration, CO2 decreases much more slowly (surface exchange only)\",\n    \"test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla: K_LA(CO2)/K_LA(O2) = 0.91 constant across aeration intensities\",\n    \"test_aeration_raises_ph_with_elevated_co2: pH rises ≥ 0.2 units over 12h with aeration and elevated CO2\",\n    \"test_co2_equilibrium_concentration: at 25°C, atmospheric CO2 equilibrium = 0.5-0.7 mg/L CO2 (verified)\",\n    \"test_temperature_affects_equilibrium: 20°C holds more CO2 than 30°C (Henry's law temperature dependence confirmed)\",\n    \"test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume: concentration dynamics are volume-independent (K_LA model verified)\",\n    \"test_aerated_vs_nonaerated_co2_levels: after 100h, aerated tank CO2 closer to equilibrium than passive tank\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Pre-existing test failure in budget_helpers.rs (trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers) is unrelated to CO2 — it concerns nitrogen budget tracking for plant trimming actions\",\n    \"The K_LA cap at 1.0 (explicit Euler stability guard) may slightly underestimate CO2 exchange at very high aeration intensities, but this is a deliberate numerical safety choice shared with the O2 system\",\n    \"CO2 injection hardware (aquarium CO2 systems) is not yet modeled — only atmospheric exchange is implemented. This is noted as future work in the project\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3a6e0fba-419d-4c21-8162-56b82cdcb1dc","total_cost_usd":0.8378293000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":51588,"cache_read_input_tokens":264872,"output_tokens":4367,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":51588,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":93,"outputTokens":12762,"cacheReadInputTokens":692828,"cacheCreationInputTokens":112458,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.2737583,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":7,"outputTokens":4367,"cacheReadInputTokens":264872,"cacheCreationInputTokens":51588,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5640710000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"8072107e-5b51-4fd9-bc48-0b3be5c0cd9c"}
